[en.FOCUS_C12_CANTER_CREEK_AGREEMENT]
Canter Creek Agreement

[en.FOCUS_C12_CANTER_CREEK_AGREEMENT_desc]
The rock farm shares a long, narrow border with Las Pegasus. If Las Pegasus were to side with the Empire, even without considering its advanced war technology, it would be forced to allocate a significant number of troops for defense—a scenario completely unacceptable to the Pie family. Fortunately, the Flim Flam brothers are nothing but profit-driven bastards; as long as we can convince them that even by remaining neutral they can secure more benefits than by siding with the Empire, they won’t refuse, which leaves me room to negotiate with them properly.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_CANTER_CREEK_AGREEMENT]
《奔马溪协议》

[zh.FOCUS_C12_CANTER_CREEK_AGREEMENT_desc]
采石农场与洛马基有着狭长的边境线，如果洛马基站选择站在帝国一方，就算不谈洛马基先进的战争科技，也至少需要被迫分出大量部队去防守，这对派家族而言是完全不可接受的。好在，弗莱姆兄弟是两个唯利是图的混蛋，只要让他们觉得哪怕保持中立也能获取到比站在帝国一方更多的利益，他们就不会拒绝这么做，这让我可以跟他们好好谈判


[en.PIHC_C12_MARBLE_PIE_MEETS_TWO_BROTHERS_TOOLTIP]
Marble Pie will meet the Flim Flam brothers to discuss relations with Las Pegasus.

[zh.PIHC_C12_MARBLE_PIE_MEETS_TWO_BROTHERS_TOOLTIP]
大理石派将与弗莱姆兄弟会面，商讨与洛马基的关系。
